<div id="selection-chip-css">
  <h1>Selection Chip CSS Component</h1>

  <p>
    A selection chip is an ARIA toggle button that applies or unapplies its
    value to a section of a form or application.
  </p>
  <p>
    Selection chips typically appear in groups (e.g. "Recommended Categories").
  </p>
  <p>
    After selection chip is loaded in the dom, add
    <code>selection-chip--animated</code> so the animations can work
  </p>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <button class="selection-chip" type="button" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="selection-chip__text">Football</span>
        <svg
          class="selection-chip__trailing icon icon--12"
          width="13"
          height="12"
        >
          <icon-symbol name="close-12"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <span style="margin-right: 8px;"/>
    </div>
  </div>
  <highlight-code type="html">
    <button class="selection-chip" type="button" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="selection-chip__text">Football</span>
      <svg
        class="selection-chip__trailing icon icon--12"
        width="13"
        height="12"
      >
        <use href="#icon-close-12"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </highlight-code>
</div>
